## Upstream data attribution

The generated map artefacts (PMTiles, GeoJSON, demand_data.json) are
derivative works built from third-party data sources, each governed by its
own licence. Use of the generated data must comply with all of the following:

- **OpenStreetMap** — base road/water/landuse vectors. © OpenStreetMap
  contributors, licensed under the Open Database Licence (ODbL) 1.0.
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

- **Overture Maps** — building footprints + heights. Buildings theme is
  ODbL-licensed (derived from OSM and Microsoft Open Buildings). Other
  Overture themes are CDLA-Permissive-2.0.
  https://overturemaps.org/about/licensing/

- **Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS) 2021 Census** — Mesh Block
  boundaries, SA1/SA2 statistical areas, G01 person counts, W01A
  Place-of-Work counts. © Commonwealth of Australia, licensed under
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0).
  https://www.abs.gov.au/website-privacy-disclaimer-and-copyright

- **Victorian Department of Education** — school locations and enrolments
  (`dv402-SchoolLocations2025`, `dv403-AllSchoolsEnrolments-2025`).
  © State of Victoria, licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  https://discover.data.vic.gov.au/

Tooling acknowledgements:

- **depot** — Subway Builder Modded map generation library
  (https://github.com/Subway-Builder-Modded/depot, GPL-3.0).
- **Demand-Adder** — `create_new_demand_points` binary by rslurry
  (https://github.com/rslurry/Demand-Adder).
- **subwaybuilder-sydney** — pipeline structure adapted from Will Barouch's
  Sydney mod (https://github.com/WillBarouch/subwaybuilder-sydney, CC0-1.0).
- **OSRM** — routing engine (https://github.com/Project-OSRM/osrm-backend,
  BSD-2-Clause).
